<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Non-Employee Director
Compensation Limit</span>.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</i></b>The aggregate value of all compensation granted or paid to any non-employee director
