is paid in full, and $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--Investments_iI_pp0p0_c20251231__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--December2023FinancingMember_zfD2aBz9sb8d" title="Investments"><span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--Investments_iI_pp0p0_c20241231__us-gaap--FinancialInstrumentAxis__custom--December2023FinancingMember_z6VMIe1QQZzf"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Investments" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_December2023FinancingMember" id="Fact001500" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Investments" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_December2023FinancingMember" id="Fact001501" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">1,132,869</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>
is recorded as an investment at December 31, 2025 and December 31, 2024.</p>

